    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A lovely bright and spacious well maintained family home in this very popular coastal residential location. Within walking distance of the Clogherhead village centre, beach and local primary school,  \r\n\r\nNo 24 The Beeches has the added benefit of a sheltered south facing rear garden and overlooks a large green to the front. Constructed originally by local builder with excellent reputation, The Beeches is regarded as one of the finest developments in the village. A tasteful red brick facade is complemented by double cobblelock driveway. The tasteful modern interior decor features a generous sized living room to the front with a fine marble fireplace as focal point.  Double doors lead through to the kitchen/dining room with 'L' shaped south facing sunroom.  A centre island with granite work surface is an added attraction, while the utility room is fully plumbed and has a good size guest toilet.  Upstairs there are three bedrooms, two of which have their own en-suite and all with wardrobe space. The family bathroom is fully tiled. The sunny rear garden has recently been upgraded to astro turf ideal for young kids during the wet winter months.\r\n\r\nA really great family home ideal for anyone seeking a quality home in a highly sought after location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: 4.71m x 1.9m\r\nLiving Room: 5.23m x 4.37m\r\nKitchen/Dining/sunroom: 6.45m x 5.6m \r\nUtility\r\nDownstairs w/c \r\nUpstairs\r\nBedroom 1: 3.87m x 3,3m \r\nEn suite shower room\r\nBed 2: 3.95m x 3.38m\r\nEn suite shower room\r\nBed 3: 2.57m x 1.75m\r\nFamily Bathroom: 2.24m x 1.75m"
      },
      {
